## What stays OUT of the Worker's static-asset bundle.
##
## The full editor export is 53 MB and one of its files (index.side.wasm, 44 MB) is past
## Cloudflare's 25 MiB per-asset limit — it deploys to R2 instead, via
## tools/deploy-web.mjs. Everything else in this directory rides inside the Worker.
